# Production build only (Vite auto-loads .env.production during `vite build`).
# "/api" is SAME-ORIGIN — the Vercel Python function serves it via the
# vercel.json rewrite — so the browser makes no cross-origin request and CORS
# never engages. Contains NO secret (the Google Maps key is injected as a Vercel
# build-time env var, never committed). Vite inlines VITE_* at build time.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
